# Shop: decimal quantities for products sold by the kg

A variant can now be sold by the kilogram, not only by the piece. The price is per kilogram, and the ordered quantity can be precise, for example 1.25 kg. Stock follows the same unit. Variants sold by the piece stay as they are.

This is useful when [a restaurant, or a member without a membership](/handbook/shop#access-without-membership), orders products that are weighed rather than counted. Those orders need a finer quantity than one pack or one piece.

On each new variant, choose the unit, kilogram or piece. Existing variants stay pieces and cannot be changed directly.
